    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35764" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pessĭmo</span></b> , āre,
			v. a.
		pessimus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to make utterly bad</i>, <i>to spoil
				completely</i>, <i>to ruin</i> (eccl. Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plebem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Ecclus. 36, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">te ipsum pessimabis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 38, 22</span></i>
			.—<i>Pass.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pessimabor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Ecclus. 11, 26</span></i>
			.</div>
